My alarm is ringing.
I wake up.
It is morning now.
I walk to the kitchen.
I turn on the stove.
I take water in a pot.
The water is boiling.
I make a cup of hot coffee.
I turn off the stove.
I go to the balcony with the coffee.
I am standing on the balcony.
A nice breeze is blowing.
The weather outside is very beautiful.
I am slowly drinking the coffee.
I look at the road below.
The city of Kochi is waking up.
I like this time very much.
A new day begins.
